                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Ambassador Riddle.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-03-19"><hi rendition="#italic">March 19,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Riddle is directed to make inquiries and to cable when Belgium, China, and
                    Turkey assent.)</p>
            </div>
